(8,'CAD with Preserved LV Function (post-revascularization)','ihd','Known CAD, post-PCI / post-CABG, no resting WMA, preserved EF.','{\"rv_wall_thickness\":\"4\",\"rv_dimension\":\"20\",\"tapse\":\"20\",\"ivc_size\":\"17\",\"ivs\":\"10\",\"lvpw\":\"10\",\"lv_edd\":\"48\",\"lv_esd\":\"32\",\"epss\":\"5\",\"mapse\":\"14\",\"la_size\":\"38\",\"ao_root\":\"32\",\"ef_percent\":\"55%\",\"fs_percent\":\"32%\",\"lap_ee\":\"9\",\"pap\":\"20\",\"lv_diastolic_function\":\"Grade I - Impaired Relaxation\",\"lv_systolic_function\":\"Normal\",\"ea_ratio\":\"E\\/A &lt;1.0 - Grade I\",\"ivs_motion\":\"Normal \\/ Intact\",\"pericardium_status\":\"Normal\",\"rv_longitudinal_function\":\"Normal\",\"rv_transverse_function\":\"Normal\",\"rv_paradoxical_movement\":\"Absent\",\"ias_status\":\"Intact\",\"pericardial_effusion\":\"None\",\"mv_velocity\":\"80\",\"mv_gradient\":\"2\",\"mitral_valve\":\"Mild MR\",\"av_velocity\":\"160\",\"av_gradient\":\"10\",\"aortic_valve\":\"Normal - no AS, no AR\",\"tv_velocity\":\"80\",\"tv_gradient\":\"2\",\"tricuspid_valve\":\"Mild TR\",\"pv_velocity\":\"110\",\"pv_gradient\":\"10\",\"pulmonary_valve\":\"Normal - no PR\",\"impression\":\"Known coronary artery disease, status post revascularization.\\n\\n1. Normal LV size and wall thickness.\\n2. Preserved LV systolic function. EF = 55%. No resting regional wall motion abnormality.\\n3. Grade I diastolic dysfunction (impaired relaxation).\\n4. Normal RV size and function.\\n5. Mild functional MR, mild TR. Other valves normal.\\n6. No pericardial effusion.\\n\\nCONCLUSION: Stable CAD with preserved LV function and Grade I LV diastolic dysfunction.\",\"recommendations\":\"Continue DAPT \\/ antiplatelet as advised.\\nHigh-intensity statin.\\nOptimise BP, glycemic control, lipid profile.\\nRepeat echo in 12 months or sooner if new symptoms.\",\"anterior_motion\":\"Normal\",\"anteroseptal_motion\":\"Normal\",\"inferior_motion\":\"Normal\",\"inferoseptal_motion\":\"Normal\",\"lateral_motion\":\"Normal\",\"poster