(2334,'ENC/2026/00062',375,1,242,NULL,'2026-05-18','11:47:13','New Visit','Open',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'<p>Routine antenatal visit. No bleeding PV, no leaking, foetal movements perceived well.</p>','<p>G_P_L_, period of gestation _ weeks by LMP. No bleeding PV, no leaking, no abdominal pain. Foetal movements good.</p>','<p><br></p>','<p><br></p>','<p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'<p>Wt / BP / Pallor / Pedal oedema documented. P/A – uterus per period of gestation, FHS heard / FM+. Symphyseal-fundal height noted.</p>','<p>Antenatal — _ weeks, low-risk / high-risk pregnancy.</p>','<p>Continue iron, calcium, folic acid. Routine ANC investigations as per gestational age. Tetanus toxoid as scheduled. Review in 4 weeks / earlier if any warning signs.</p>',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'2026-05-18 06:17:13','2026-05-18 06:17:21'),
(2335,'ENC/2026/00063',587,1,243,NULL,'2026-05-25','14:42:54','New Visit','Open',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'120','80',72.0,98.6,99.0,16.0,'100','<p>Burning epigastric pain, sour eructations, occasional nausea x few days.</p>','<p>Epigastric burning, retrosternal discomfort, worse on empty stomach / lying down. No haematemesis, no melaena, no weight loss.</p>','<p><br></p>','<p><br></p>','<p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'<p>Soft abdomen, mild epigastric tenderness. No guarding, no rigidity. Bowel sounds normal.</p>','<p>Acute gastritis / GERD.</p>','<p>PPI before food x 2 weeks. Avoid spicy/oily food, late meals, alcohol, smoking. Small frequent meals, head-end elevation. Endoscopy if symptoms persist &gt; 4 weeks or alarm features.</p>',NULL,7,'2026-06-01',1,'2026-05-25 09:12:54','2026-05-25 09:13:28'),
(2336,'ENC/2026/00064',375,1,247,NULL,'2026-05-26','03:18:53','Revisit','Open',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,100,'2026-05-25 21:48:53','2026-05-25 21:48:53'),
(2337,'ENC/2026/00065',213,1,245,NULL,'2026-05-31','03:06:54','New Visit','Open',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'<p>Burning epigastric pain, sour eructations, occasional nausea x few days.</p>','<p>Epigastric burning, retrosternal discomfort, worse on empty stomach / lying down. No haematemesis, no melaena, no weight loss.</p>','<p><br></p>','<p><br></p>','<p><br></p>',NULL,NULL,'<p>Soft abdomen, mild epigastric tenderness. No guarding, no rigidity. Bowel sounds normal.</p>','<p>Acute gastritis / GERD.</p>','<p>PPI before food x 2 weeks. Avoid spicy/oily food, late meals, alcohol, smoking. Small frequent meals, head-end elevation. Endoscopy if symptoms persist &gt; 4 weeks or alarm features.</p>',NULL,7,'2026-06-07',104,'2026-05-30 21:36:54','2026-05-30 21:37:05');
