(4,'diet','<p>&nbsp;❯ also make diet charts to select from based on bmi, Diabetic Diet,&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;Hypertension Diet, Uric Acd diet, High Cholesterol diet, cardiac pt diet,&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;also a patient may have more than one disorder, pt could be having HTN,&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CAD, DM, High Uric Acid and Hypothyroidism also, so create a diet page&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;where we can enterheight wt n bmi auto calculates, then recommend how&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;many kcal diet is required to achieve a good weight loss....&nbsp;</p>',0,1,'2026-05-05 00:56:03','2026-05-05 00:56:03'),
(5,'Features of SpecialityCare','<p>name: SpecialityCare — Full Feature Writeup</p><p>description: Comprehensive writeup of all modules and features in the specialitycare HMS, suitable for demos, proposals, or handoffs</p><p>type: project</p><p>originSessionId: 3c13ea91-6996-481d-bb0a-79e52593609d</p><p>---</p><p># SpecialityCare — Hospital Management System</p><p>**Demo Clinic Pvt. Ltd. | Laravel 11 | Built May 2025**</p><p><br></p><p>---</p><p><br></p><p>## Overview</p><p><br></p><p>SpecialityCare is a full-featured, web-based Hospital Management System built for a multi-speciality clinic. It covers the complete patient journey — from appointment booking and OPD queue management through clinical encounter documentation, laboratory, pharmacy, IPD admission, billing, and discharge — all within a single unified platform accessible by admin, doctors, nurses, and receptionists through role-based access control.</p><p><br></p><p>---</p><p><br></p><p>## 1. Patient Management</p><p><br></p><p>- **Registration &amp; Profile** — Complete patient registration with JHC ID auto-generation, demographics, contact details, emergency contacts, and photo upload.</p><p>- **Global Search** — Instant search from any page by name, JHC ID, or phone number with a slide-in Quick View panel showing vitals, last encounter, outstanding balance, and one-click actions (New Bill, Admit, OPD Token).</p><p>- **Deduplication** — Smart duplicate detection on registration; admin can merge duplicate records without data loss.</p><p>- **Allergy Tracking** — Allergen and allergy records linked to the patient profile; surface during prescribing.</p><p>- **Document Store** — Upload and manage patient documents (lab reports, referral letters, consents, etc.).</p><p>- **Outstanding Dues** — Real-time outstanding balance shown on the patient profile and in the Quick View panel.</p><p><br></p><p>---</p><p><br></p><p>## 2. Appointments</p><p><br></p><p>- **Online Booking** — Book appointments with doctor, date, time, and purpose.</p><p>- **Status Workflow** — Scheduled → Confirmed → Checked-In → In-Progress → Completed / Cancelled.</p><p>- **One-Click Check-In / Start Visit** — Receptionist checks in the patient; doctor starts the encounter directly from the appointment card.</p><p>- **Dashboard View** — Today\'s appointment list with status badges and action buttons on the main dashboard.</p><p><br></p><p>---</p><p><br></p><p>## 3. OPD Queue Management</p><p><br></p><p>- **Token Issuance** — Issue OPD tokens at the front desk with patient search, doctor assignment, and priority (Normal / Urgent).</p><p>- **Live Queue Board** — Public-facing display board showing called token with auto-refresh.</p><p>- **Wait-Time Column** — Real-time elapsed wait badge on the nursing station queue: green (&lt;15 min), amber (15–30 min), red (&gt;30 min).</p><p>- **OPD Register** — Printable day-wise register of all tokens.</p><p>- **Token Slip** — Printable token slip with patient details and queue number.</p><p><br></p><p>---</p><p><br></p><p>## 4. Triage / Nursing Station</p><p><br></p><p>- **Combined Queue View** — Single page showing pending triage and full active queue, auto-refreshes every 45 seconds.</p><p>- **Full Triage Form** — Capture triage level (Green / Yellow / Red), chief complaint, BP, pulse, temperature (°F), SpO₂, weight, height, BMI (auto-computed), blood glucose, and nurse notes.</p><p>- **Quick Vitals** — Inline AJAX modal on the queue row to record BP, pulse, temp, SpO₂, and weight without leaving the page and without requiring a triage level — ideal for rapid vital capture before the doctor is ready.</p><p>- **Priority Escalation** — Red triage automatically escalates the token to urgent.</p><p>- **Re-Triage** — Nurse can update triage data at any point before the visit ends.</p><p>- **Triage Summary View** — View saved triage record with full vitals and assessor details.</p><p><br></p><p>---</p><p><br></p><p>## 5. Clinical Encounters</p><p><br></p><p>- **Encounter Workflow** — Each visit creates an Encounter linked to the patient, doctor, and appointment (optional).</p><p>- **SOAP Notes** — Structured Subjective / Objective / Assessment / Plan fields with voice-to-text dictation (Web Speech API) and auto-save every 30 seconds.</p><p>- **Encounter Templates** — Reusable note templates per doctor or specialty.</p><p>- **Vitals Recording** — BP, pulse, temperature, SpO₂, weight, height, BMI on every encounter.</p><p>- **Vitals Trend Charts** — Interactive chart on the patient profile showing vitals history across encounters.</p><p>- **Diagnosis** — ICD-style diagnosis entry with primary/secondary classification.</p><p>- **Follow-Up Scheduling** — Set a follow-up date; due follow-ups appear on the dashboard and nurse station.</p><p>- **Discharge Summary Auto-Draft** — Auto-generates a structured discharge summary from the encounter data.</p><p>- **ECG &amp; Echo Recordings** — Attach ECG and echocardiogram records to an encounter.</p><p><br></p><p>---</p><p><br></p><p>## 6. Prescriptions</p><p><br></p><p>- **Prescription Builder** — Add medicines with dose, frequency, duration, route, and instructions.</p><p>- **Prescription Templates** — Save and reuse prescription templates for common conditions.</p><p>- **Drug Interaction Alerts** — Real-time warnings when adding a medicine that interacts with another already on the prescription (backed by a ~100-rule interaction database).</p><p>- **Expiring Rx Alert** — Dashboard badge and sidebar card listing undispensed prescriptions whose duration expires within 7 days, so nurses can follow up on collection.</p><p>- **Print / Email Rx** — One-click print and email of the prescription PDF to the patient.</p><p>- **Dispensing Link** — Prescription items flow directly into the pharmacy dispensing workflow; dispensed items are marked to avoid re-dispensing.</p><p><br></p><p>---</p><p><br></p><p>## 7. Laboratory</p><p><br></p><p>- **Lab Order Management** — Doctors raise lab orders from within an encounter; orders are visible to the lab technician.</p><p>- **Lab Tests &amp; Panels** — Configurable test catalogue with reference ranges by age and gender.</p><p>- **Result Entry** — Technician enters results per test item; abnormal values are flagged automatically.</p><p>- **Status Workflow** — Ordered → Collected → Processing → Completed.</p><p>- **Results Ready Alert** — Dashboard badge when lab results are completed today and awaiting clinical review.</p><p>- **Pending Labs KPI** — Dashboard stat card for all in-progress orders.</p><p>- **Print Report** — Formatted lab report printout.</p><p><br></p><p>---</p><p><br></p><p>## 8. Radiology</p><p><br></p><p>- **Radiology Orders** — Raise radiology requests (X-Ray, MRI, CT, Ultrasound, etc.) from the encounter.</p><p>- **Report Entry** — Attach findings and reports to the order.</p><p>- **Status Tracking** — Ordered → Reported workflow.</p><p><br></p><p>---</p><p><br></p><p>## 9. Pharmacy</p><p><br></p><p>- **Medicine Catalogue** — Master list of medicines with category, form, strength, reorder level, and HSN code.</p><p>- **Stock Management** — Batch-wise stock register with purchase date, expiry date, and quantity; FIFO-aware.</p><p>- **Dispensing** — Dispense against OPD prescriptions; quantity is deducted from the correct batch.</p><p>- **Low Stock Alert** — Dashboard badge and detail card for medicines at or below reorder level.</p><p>- **Expiring Stock Alert** — Dashboard badge and detail card for batches expiring within 90 days.</p><p>- **Drug Interaction Rules** — Admin-managed interaction rules (~100 seeded pairs); real-time warnings in the prescription builder.</p><p>- **Pharmacy Dashboard** — Overview of dispensing queue, stock status, and expiry calendar.</p><p><br></p><p>---</p><p><br></p><p>## 10. IPD (In-Patient Department)</p><p><br></p><p>- **Admissions** — Admit a patient to a ward and bed with admitting doctor, admission date, diagnosis, and deposit.</p><p>- **Ward &amp; Bed Management** — Configure wards and beds; track availability in real time.</p><p>- **Bed Board** — Visual bed board color-coded by length of stay: green (day 1), amber (days 2–3), orange (days 4–6), red (day 7+) with a day-count badge on each tile and a ward-level long-stay alert.</p><p>- **IPD Census** — Dashboard sidebar widget showing patient count per ward.</p><p>- **Room Charges** — Daily room charge generation for all admitted patients (one-click from dashboard).</p><p>- **IPD Medications** — Administer inpatient medications and log doses.</p><p>- **Diet Prescriptions** — Attach diet plans to IPD admissions.</p><p>- **Nursing Notes (I/O Chart)** — Intake/output charting for IPD patients.</p><p>- **Discharge Process** — Discharge with date, discharge diagnosis, condition on discharge, and auto-drafted summary.</p><p>- **IPD Charges** — Track all charges (room, procedures, consumables) for the admission.</p><p>- **Deposits &amp; Advance** — Record and track advance deposits against the admission.</p><p><br></p><p>---</p><p><br></p><p>## 11. Billing &amp; Finance</p><p><br></p><p>- **OPD Bills** — Generate itemised bills for outpatient visits with service charges.</p><p>- **Package Billing** — Pre-configured service packages that populate multiple line items at once.</p><p>- **Quick Bill Modal** — From the encounter page, open a pre-populated bill modal with consultation fee and lab items already filled; add more services from a searchable catalogue; set discount, payment method, and paid amount — without navigating away.</p><p>- **IPD Bills** — Consolidated billing for all IPD charges on discharge.</p><p>- **Payments** — Record full or partial payments; track balance due.</p><p>- **Overdue Bills Badge** — Sidebar badge showing count of unpaid bills older than 7 days.</p><p>- **Pending Bills Alert** — Dashboard alert for all unpaid bills.</p><p>- **Insurance &amp; Claims** — Attach insurance details to admissions; manage claims.</p><p>- **Day-End Report** — End-of-day financial summary for cash reconciliation.</p><p>- **Outstanding Dues** — Per-patient and aggregate outstanding balance views.</p><p><br></p><p>---</p><p><br></p><p>## 12. Dashboard &amp; Analytics</p><p><br></p><p>- **KPI Cards** — Live stat cards for OPD tokens, appointments, IPD census, beds, revenue, labs, and pharmacy — auto-refreshed via AJAX every 60 seconds.</p><p>- **Revenue Chart** — Monthly OPD + IPD combined bar chart for the current year.</p><p>- **Revenue Drill-Down** — Click any month on the revenue chart to open a day-by-day modal chart with OPD, IPD, and combined totals.</p><p>- **Alerts Section** — Consolidated alert panel: pending labs, low stock, expiring stock, unpaid bills, lab results ready, and expiring prescriptions.</p><p>- **Follow-Ups Due** — Sidebar widget listing today\'s follow-up encounters with one-click navigation.</p><p>- **Diagnosis Analytics** — Frequency charts for diagnoses across encounters (top conditions, trends).</p><p>- **Bed Occupancy %** — Live occupancy percentage with a color-coded progress bar on the dashboard.</p><p><br></p><p>---</p><p><br></p><p>## 13. Notifications</p><p><br></p><p>- **In-App Notification Bell** — Bell icon in the topbar with unread badge; dropdown lists recent system notifications.</p><p>- **Admin Email Notifications** — Automatic email alerts to admin on key events: new admission, discharge, new patient registration, lab result ready, low stock.</p><p><br></p><p>---</p><p><br></p><p>## 14. Paediatric Features</p><p><br></p><p>- **Vaccination Tracker** — Record and track immunisations against the standard vaccination schedule; due and overdue vaccines highlighted.</p><p>- **Paediatric Growth Charts** — WHO-standard weight-for-age and height-for-age charts plotted from vitals history.</p><p><br></p><p>---</p><p><br></p><p>## 15. Consent &amp; Legal</p><p><br></p><p>- **Consent Templates** — Configurable consent form templates (surgical, anaesthesia, general treatment, etc.).</p><p>- **Consent Records** — Issue and record signed consent for a patient encounter or admission; attach scanned signature.</p><p>- **Medical Certificates** — Generate medical fitness or leave certificates from an encounter.</p><p><br></p><p>---</p><p><br></p><p>## 16. Referrals</p><p><br></p><p>- **Outgoing Referrals** — Refer a patient to an external specialist or facility; track referral status.</p><p>- **Referral Dashboard** — Overview of all active referrals.</p><p><br></p><p>---</p><p><br></p><p>## 17. Operation Theatre</p><p><br></p><p>- **OT Scheduling** — Schedule surgical procedures with surgeon, anaesthetist, date, and room.</p><p>- **OT Notes** — Record operative findings and post-op instructions.</p><p><br></p><p>---</p><p><br></p><p>## 18. Staff &amp; Administration</p><p><br></p><p>- **User Management** — Create staff accounts with roles: Admin, Doctor, Nurse, Receptionist, Lab Technician, Pharmacist.</p><p>- **Role-Based Access** — Each role sees only the screens and actions relevant to them.</p><p>- **Doctor Profiles** — Specialization, qualifications, schedule, and signature for prescriptions.</p><p>- **Settings** — Hospital name, logo, address, contact details, currency, and system preferences.</p><p>- **Activity Logs** — Full audit trail of all key actions with user, timestamp, and description.</p><p><br></p><p>---</p><p><br></p><p>## 19. Data &amp; Integration</p><p><br></p><p>- **Backup** — One-click full database backup downloadable as a SQL file.</p><p>- **CSV Export** — Export patients, encounters, billing, and lab data to CSV for reporting.</p><p>- **Import** — Bulk patient import via CSV.</p><p>- **Email** — SMTP-integrated email for prescriptions, bills, and admin notifications.</p><p>- **Print** — Formatted print views for tokens, slips, bills, lab reports, prescriptions, and discharge summaries.</p><p>- **API** — Internal API endpoints for AJAX operations (search, stats refresh, drill-down data, quick actions).</p><p><br></p><p>---</p><p><br></p><p>## 20. UX &amp; Developer Notes</p><p><br></p><p>- **Responsive Design** — Works on desktop and tablet; sidebar collapses on smaller screens.</p><p>- **Design System** — Custom CSS variables (`--sc-navy`, `--sc-teal`, `--sc-amber`, `--sc-red`, `--sc-green`) applied consistently; card, table, badge, and button components.</p><p>- **Global Search** — Searches patients, encounters, and bills from the topbar on any page.</p><p>- **Quick View Panel** — Slide-in patient summary panel from search results without navigating away.</p><p>- **Voice-to-Text** — Web Speech API dictation on clinical note fields.</p><p>- **Auto-Save** — Encounter notes auto-saved every 30 seconds to prevent data loss.</p><p>- **Select2 Dropdowns** — Searchable medicine and service dropdowns throughout.</p><p>- **Chart.js** — Interactive charts for revenue, vitals trends, and growth charts.</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>',0,1,'2026-05-06 23:03:43','2026-05-06 23:03:43');
